# Prisma 6

Stay on Prisma 6. Do not upgrade to Prisma 7.

- Schema: `prisma/schema.prisma`. Client singleton: `lib/db.ts`.
- Prisma CLI reads `.env`. Next.js reads `.env.local`. Keep DB URLs in both when changing connection strings — do not print them.
- Default workflow is `npm run db:push` and `npm run db:seed`. Do not add a migration folder unless the user asks.
- Never `migrate reset` or drop the Supabase database.
- Storage PDFs go through `lib/supabase.ts` and `SUPABASE_STORAGE_BUCKET`. Do not write local PDFs into git.
